+ * CopaMundial MCP Server
+ *
+ * Model Context Protocol server for AI agent integration
+ * Provides tools, resources, and prompts for sports management
+ *
+ * TOOLS (11 total):
+ * 1. create_team
+ * 2. find_teams
+ * 3. schedule_match
