+#### Ticket 1.1.3: Add Password Strength Validation
+
+**Priority:** P1 - HIGH  
+**Severity:** HIGH  
+**Effort:** 3 hours  
+**Risk:** LOW  
+**Files:** `lib/auth.ts`
