+**Effort:** 4 hours  
+**Risk:** MEDIUM  
+**Files:** `lib/sanitizer.ts`, components using HTML
+
+**Problem:**
+Regex-based HTML sanitization is fundamentally insecure and can be bypassed with modern XSS techniques.
+
+**Implementation:**
